    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i'm just worried about the hospital bill and the wait times. he's not even vomiting or anything, he's just... out of it. like he's not quite there. but he was fine yesterday. do you really think it's that serious? it's probably just the high temp messing with his head, right? i can just keep giving him tylenol and cool cloths for now?",
